                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "那由他，我啊…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802401,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102936/vo_full_102905-5-49"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "知道了让世间知晓魔法少女@反而会产生出绝望…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802401,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102936/vo_full_102905-5-50"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "但是，我很害怕@将这个假说告诉那由他…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802401,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102936/vo_full_102905-5-51"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "我们的目的终将化为泡影@这样过于残酷的结局"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802401,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102936/vo_full_102905-5-52"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "就算只是个可能性@我也不想告诉那由他"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802401,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102936/vo_full_102905-5-53"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "所以，我就想到@在结束对假说的验证之前"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802401,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102936/vo_full_102905-5-54"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "太助",
                "textRight": "我要从那由他的面前消失…"
            },
            {
